@budget_2026
# prose-audit: Grade A — The pre-election offer binds labour, municipal and KPO promises to a visible executable budget.
title: The pre-election budget
subtitle: The final full budget before 2027 is a delivery test.
face-image: img/poland/events/sejm-voting-device.webp
new-page: true
tags: poland_event, poland_event_calendar
priority: 5
order: 90
max-visits: 1
view-if: continuous_campaign = 1 and year = 2026 and month = 12 and annual_budget_done_2026 = 0
