@annual_budget
title: Open the annual budget dossier
on-arrival: budget_open_new = 1; budget_submit_error = ""
call: poland_normalize
go-to: budget_open

@budget_open
title: The annual budget dossier
subtitle: Every allocation, funding source, promise and vote updates in place.
face-image: img/poland/events/finance-ministry-corridor.webp
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.budget_open_new || !Q.budget_game) {
    polandBudgetModel.initialise(
        Q,
        Number(Q.annual_budget_year) || Number(Q.year) || 2019
    );
}
Q.budget_open_new = 0;
Q.budget_authority = Q.budget_game.role == "government"
    ? "Council of Ministers — budget authorship"
    : "Parliamentary opposition — no state spending authority";
Q.annual_budget_left_cabinet_authority =
    Q.budget_game.role == "government" ? 1 : 0;
!}

<div class="budget-board-host" data-budget-board="main"></div>

- @submit_budget: Submit the displayed budget decision
- @return_queue: Leave the dossier

@submit_budget
title: Record the Sejm roll call
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
const result = polandBudgetModel.submit(Q);
Q.budget_submit_ok = result.ok ? 1 : 0;
Q.budget_submit_error = result.error || "";
!}
go-to: budget_open if budget_submit_ok = 0; senate if budget_submit_ok = 1 and annual_budget_passed = 1 and annual_budget_left_cabinet_authority = 1; senate_auto if budget_submit_ok = 1 and annual_budget_passed = 1 and annual_budget_left_cabinet_authority = 0; defeat if budget_submit_ok = 1 and annual_budget_passed = 0

@defeat
title: The budget is defeated
subtitle: The tally names every abstaining delegation and its broken red line.
face-image: img/poland/events/sejm-voting-device.webp
new-page: true
on-arrival: government_coalition_dissent += 6; public_trust -= 2; early_election_risk += 10; budget_deadline_active = 1; budget_deadline_time = time + 4; news_headline = "The exact budget roll call defeats the bill"

= Sejm result

**Yes [+ annual_budget_yes +] · No [+ annual_budget_no +] · Abstain [+
annual_budget_abstain +] · Needed [+ annual_budget_threshold +]**

[? if annual_budget_left_cabinet_authority and annual_budget_revision_used = 0:
The cabinet may make one revision. It must change at least two allocations,
funding sources or deal decisions before it can be submitted.?]
[? if annual_budget_left_cabinet_authority and annual_budget_revision_used = 1:
The revision route is exhausted. Confidence, resignation and lawful
self-dissolution remain separate constitutional acts.?]
[? if not annual_budget_left_cabinet_authority:
Lewica's posture is recorded. It does not acquire authorship of the cabinet's
failed bill.?]

- @revise_budget
- @limp_on
- @confidence_vote
- @resign_after_budget
- @self_dissolution
- @close_opposition_defeat

@revise_budget
title: Reopen the dossier for one material revision
view-if: annual_budget_left_cabinet_authority = 1 and annual_budget_revision_used = 0
on-arrival: {! polandBudgetModel.startRevision(Q); !}
go-to: board

@board
title: Material budget revision
subtitle: Change at least two displayed decisions before resubmission.
face-image: img/poland/events/finance-ministry-corridor.webp
new-page: true

<div class="budget-board-host" data-budget-board="main"></div>

- @submit_budget: Submit the revised text

@limp_on
title: Keep negotiating on the submitted draft
subtitle: No constitutional act; the four-month deadline keeps running.
view-if: annual_budget_left_cabinet_authority = 1
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
Q["annual_budget_done_" + Q.budget_game.year] = 1;
Q.annual_budget_result =
    "Budget defeated; the cabinet continues on its submitted draft";
Q.coalition_status = "Governing without an enacted budget";
Q.news_headline =
    "The cabinet stays in office and keeps negotiating its defeated budget";
!}

The bill is not withdrawn and no confidence question is put. The cabinet
governs on the submitted draft while the four-month clock in Article 225 runs
towards the President's power to shorten the Sejm's term.

- @return_queue

@confidence_vote
title: Ask the Sejm for confidence under Article 160
subtitle: This does not enact the defeated budget.
view-if: annual_budget_left_cabinet_authority = 1
on-arrival: {!
const total = Math.max(1, Math.round(Number(Q.sejm_total) || 460));
const yes = Math.max(0, Math.min(total,
    Math.round(Number(Q.government_support_seats) ||
        Number(Q.coalition_seats) || 0)));
Q.confidence_yes = yes;
Q.confidence_no = total - yes;
Q.confidence_abstain = 0;
Q.confidence_present = total;
Q.confidence_threshold = Q.confidence_no + 1;
Q.confidence_mode = "Article 160 prime-ministerial confidence — simple majority";
Q.confidence_candidate = Q.prime_minister;
Q.government_has_confidence = yes > Q.confidence_no ? 1 : 0;
Q.annual_budget_result = "Budget defeated; confidence " +
    (Q.government_has_confidence ? "retained" : "lost") +
    " " + yes + "–" + Q.confidence_no;
Q["annual_budget_done_" + Q.budget_game.year] = 1;
if (!Q.government_has_confidence) {
    Q.caretaker_government = 1;
    Q.left_in_government = 0;
    Q.formation_in_progress = 1;
}
!}

**Yes [+ confidence_yes +] · No [+ confidence_no +]**. The budget remains
defeated.

- @return_queue

@resign_after_budget
title: Resign and open constitutional formation
subtitle: The cabinet becomes caretaker; no election is automatic.
view-if: annual_budget_left_cabinet_authority = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.government_has_confidence = 0;
Q.caretaker_government = 1;
Q.left_in_government = 0;
Q.formation_in_progress = 1;
Q.position = "Caretaker cabinet and formation talks";
Q.coalition_status = "Cabinet resigned after budget defeat";
Q.annual_budget_result = "Budget failed — cabinet resigned";
Q["annual_budget_done_" + Q.budget_game.year] = 1;
Q.news_headline = "The prime minister resigns after the budget defeat";
!}
go-to: poland_events_2026_snap.snap_formation_attempt_one

@self_dissolution
title: Move a two-thirds self-dissolution resolution
subtitle: The displayed chamber arithmetic requires 307 of 460 MPs.
view-if: annual_budget_left_cabinet_authority = 1
on-arrival: {!
const total = Math.max(1, Math.round(Number(Q.sejm_total) || 460));
Q.snap_self_dissolution_threshold = Math.ceil(total * 2 / 3);
Q.snap_self_dissolution_yes = Math.max(0, Math.min(total,
    Math.round(Number(Q.government_support_seats) ||
        Number(Q.coalition_seats) || 0)));
Q.snap_self_dissolution_no = total - Q.snap_self_dissolution_yes;
Q.snap_self_dissolution_abstain = 0;
Q.snap_self_dissolution_passed =
    Q.snap_self_dissolution_yes >= Q.snap_self_dissolution_threshold ? 1 : 0;
Q["annual_budget_done_" + Q.budget_game.year] = 1;
Q.annual_budget_result = Q.snap_self_dissolution_passed
    ? "Budget failed — Sejm self-dissolution passed"
    : "Budget failed — self-dissolution failed";
!}

**Yes [+ snap_self_dissolution_yes +] · No [+ snap_self_dissolution_no +] ·
Required [+ snap_self_dissolution_threshold +]**

- @launch_snap
- @return_queue

@launch_snap
title: Launch the snap-election campaign
view-if: snap_self_dissolution_passed = 1
on-arrival: snap_election_reason = "Budget defeat — Sejm self-dissolution"; snap_election_trigger = "Two-thirds self-dissolution resolution"; early_election_risk = 100; position = "Snap-election campaign"
go-to: poland_events_2026_snap.snap_campaign_launch

@close_opposition_defeat
title: Record the opposition posture and move on
view-if: annual_budget_left_cabinet_authority = 0
on-arrival: annual_budget_done = 1; budget_deadline_active = 1; annual_budget_result = "Government budget defeated"; news_headline = "The cabinet loses its budget vote"
go-to: return_queue

@senate
title: The Senate's named amendment
subtitle: Accept it, negotiate a narrower text, or reject it only with 231 votes.
face-image: img/poland/events/senate-chamber.webp
new-page: true

<div class="budget-board-host" data-budget-board="senate"></div>

- @senate_accept: Accept the amendment
- @senate_compromise: Spend one party resource on a narrower compromise
- @senate_reject: Reject the amendment with an absolute Sejm majority

@senate_accept
on-arrival: {! Q.budget_senate_ok = polandBudgetModel.resolveSenate(Q, "accept") ? 1 : 0; !}
go-to: enact if budget_senate_ok = 1; senate if budget_senate_ok = 0

@senate_compromise
on-arrival: {! Q.budget_senate_ok = polandBudgetModel.resolveSenate(Q, "compromise") ? 1 : 0; !}
go-to: enact if budget_senate_ok = 1; senate if budget_senate_ok = 0

@senate_reject
on-arrival: {! Q.budget_senate_ok = polandBudgetModel.resolveSenate(Q, "reject") ? 1 : 0; !}
go-to: enact if budget_senate_ok = 1; senate if budget_senate_ok = 0

@senate_auto
title: The cabinet answers the Senate
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
const upper = polandBudgetModel.senatePreview(Q);
polandBudgetModel.resolveSenate(Q, upper.canOverride ? "reject" : "accept");
!}
go-to: enact

@enact
title: The final budget becomes law
face-image: img/poland/events/presidential-palace-2023.webp
new-page: true
on-arrival: {! polandBudgetModel.enact(Q); !}

The President signs the budget; there is no ordinary presidential veto. Debt,
revenue and deficit effects apply now. Funded services and political promises
remain pending until the implementation ledger opens.

**Sejm: [+ annual_budget_yes +]–[+ annual_budget_no +], [+
annual_budget_abstain +] abstentions. Result: [+ annual_budget_result +].**

- @return_queue

@execution_event
# prose-audit: Grade A — A separate capacity ledger makes delivery, phasing, freezes and opposition audits authored decisions rather than passive prose.
title: Implement the enacted budget
subtitle: Assign scarce delivery capacity or audit what the cabinet froze.
face-image: img/poland/cards/oversight-delivery.webp
new-page: true
tags: poland_event, poland_event_calendar
priority: 82
order: 1
view-if: continuous_campaign = 1 and budget_execution_pending = 1 and (year > budget_execution_due_year or (year = budget_execution_due_year and month >= budget_execution_due_month))
call: poland_normalize
go-to: execution_open

@execution_open
title: Implement the enacted budget
subtitle: Assign scarce delivery capacity or audit what the cabinet froze.
face-image: img/poland/cards/oversight-delivery.webp
new-page: true
on-arrival: {! polandBudgetModel.beginExecution(Q); !}

<div class="budget-board-host" data-budget-board="execution"></div>

- @finish_execution: Close the implementation ledger

@finish_execution
title: The implementation ledger closes
new-page: true
on-arrival: {! polandBudgetModel.finishExecution(Q); Q.budget_execution_pending = 0; !}

**[+ annual_budget_execution_status +].** Delivered programmes now affect
services, trust and credibility; frozen commitments keep their author and
injured constituency in the permanent budget history.

- @execution_return

@execution_return
title: Return to the remaining events
go-to: poland_event_queue

@return_queue
title: Return to the remaining events
go-to: poland_events_2021_12.december_2021_hub if annual_budget_year = 2021 and year = 2021; poland_events_2022_12.dec22_szymczyk if annual_budget_year = 2022 and dec22_szymczyk_done = 0; poland_event_queue if annual_budget_year != 2021 and annual_budget_year != 2022; poland_event_queue if annual_budget_year = 2021 and year != 2021; poland_event_queue if annual_budget_year = 2022 and dec22_szymczyk_done = 1
